    {
      "text": "parents to teach their children in stakes of Zion, D&C 68:25–26. Kirtland consecrated for stake to Zion, D&C 82:13 (94:1; 96:1; 104:40). Zion’s stakes must be strengthened, D&C 82:14 (96:1; 133:9). the Lord will appoint places to be called stakes for curtains or strength of Zion, D&C 101:21 (115:18). authority of high councils in stakes, D&C 107:36. bishop to be common judge in stake of Zion, D&C 107:74. converts to come forth unto Zion, or to her stakes, D&C 109:39. the Lord will appoint unto Zion other stakes in addition to Kirtland, D&C 109:59 (115:18). gathering together upon Zion and her stakes may be for defense, D&C 115:6. this shall be ensample unto stakes of Zion, D&C 119:7. stake planted in Nauvoo as cornerstone, D&C 124:2. presidency of high priests to qualify standing presidents over different stakes, D&C 124:133–34. Saints to remove to place where the Lord will locate stake, D&C 136:10.",
